    "title": "What remains in a changing stack",
    "lookup_name": "Random_Rotate_Random_XYZ",
    "description": "Two complete MultiMesh stacks fit a shared ten-metre display. Pause accumulated drift, rotation and darkening; compare fixed specimen size with unequal configured rates, then restore the initial arrangement.",
